  partName: Rear Blade
  description: The Rear Blade is another tiny, elongated component located at the
    middle-center-rear of the engine, also made from Blades texture material. Similar
    to the Rear Blade , it contributes to the turbine section's energy extraction
    process, playing a vital role in the engine's mechanical energy production. Its
    identical design to the Rear Blade highlights the engine's modular architecture,
    allowing for easier maintenance and replacement.
